ages\u002Fdjango","3.packages\u002F8.django",[383,387,391,395,398],{"title":384,"path":385,"stem":386},"Vatly Django guides","\u002Fpackages\u002Fdjango\u002Freadme","3.packages\u002F8.django\u002F0.readme",{"title":388,"path":389,"stem":390},"Webhooks, storage and outbox","\u002Fpackages\u002Fdjango\u002Fwebhooks","3.packages\u002F8.django\u002F9.webhooks",{"title":392,"path":393,"stem":394},"Billable operations","\u002Fpackages\u002Fdjango\u002Fbilling","3.packages\u002F8.django\u002F99.billing",{"title":207,"path":396,"stem":397},"\u002Fpackages\u002Fdjango\u002Fconfiguration","3.packages\u002F8.django\u002F99.configuration",{"title":399,"path":400,"stem":401},"Development, support and release","\u002Fpackages\u002Fdjango\u002Fdevelopment","3.packages\u002F8.django\u002F99.development",{"title":403,"path":404,"stem":405,"children":406},"Integrations","\u002Fintegrations","4.integrations",[407,409,413],{"title":403,"path":404,"stem":408},"4.integrations\u002Findex",{"title":410,"path":411,"stem":412},"Lovable payments with Vatly","\u002Fintegrations\u002Flovable","4.integrations\u002F1.lovable",{"title":414,"path":415,"stem":416},"Bolt payments with Vatly","\u002Fintegrations\u002Fbolt","4.integrations\u002F2.bolt",{"id":418,"title":403,"body":419,"description":559,"extension":560,"links":561,"meta":562,"navigation":563,"path":404,"seo":564,"stem":408,"__hash__":565},"docs\u002F4.integrations\u002Findex.md",{"type":420,"value":421,"toc":552},"minimark",[422,426,432,437,478,481,510,514,526,529,533,539],[423,424,425],"p",{},"Connect Vatly to the tools and platforms you use to build your app. Vatly is the European merchant of record for AI, software and digital products, handling tax and customer invoicing while your app delivers the product.",[423,427,428],{},[429,430],"span",{"id":431},"choose-your-builder",[433,434,436],"h2",{"id":435},"find-your-platform","Find your platform",[438,439,440,453],"table",{},[441,442,443],"thead",{},[444,445,446,450],"tr",{},[447,448,449],"th",{},"Platform",[447,451,452],{},"How to get started",[454,455,456,468],"tbody",{},[444,457,458,465],{},[459,460,461],"td",{},[462,463,464],"a",{"href":411},"Lovable",[459,466,467],{},"Understand how Vatly fits your Lovable app, prepare the account and secrets, and give Lovable's agent the integration brief.",[444,469,470,475],{},[459,471,472],{},[462,473,474],{"href":415},"Bolt.new",[459,476,477],{},"Connect Vatly to your existing Bolt app and backend, then have the agent build and test your checkout and billing flow.",[423,479,480],{},"The Lovable and Bolt guides describe custom integrations using Vatly's existing packages and API. They are not native payment connectors or endorsements by those platforms.",[423,482,483,486,489,492,495,498,501,504,507],{},[429,484],{"id":485},"choose-your-integration-approach",[429,487],{"id":488},"create-a-checkout-with-the-javascript-sdk",[429,490],{"id":491},"create-a-checkout",[429,493],{"id":494},"prepare-your-vatly-account",[429,496],{"id":497},"keep-credentials-on-the-server",[429,499],{"id":500},"verify-webhooks-before-granting-access",[429,502],{"id":503},"before-you-connect",[429,505],{"id":506},"test-before-publishing",[429,508],{"id":509},"documentation-for-your-agent",[433,511,513],{"id":512},"framework-packages","Framework packages",[423,515,516,517,519,520,522,523,525],{},"Using a framework rather than an app builder? Official ",[462,518,176],{"href":181}," and ",[462,521,379],{"href":385}," packages integrate Vatly with your application. Their installation, configuration and API guides live under ",[462,524,116],{"href":117},", alongside the SDKs and fluent packages, rather than being duplicated here.",[423,527,528],{},"These packages are in alpha. Every alpha release may include breaking changes. Pin exact versions during alpha.",[433,530,532],{"id":531},"connecting-another-app","Connecting another app?",[423,534,535,536,538],{},"Start with ",[462,537,26],{"href":27}," to understand what Vatly handles, what your app needs, and what to ask your developer or agent to build. It also helps you choose a fluent package, SDK, or direct API approach.",[423,540,541,542,544,545,548,549,551],{},"If you are ready for your first API request, follow the ",[462,543,14],{"href":15},". Implementation examples live in the ",[462,546,547],{"href":117},"package docs",", with exact endpoint and field details in the ",[462,550,302],{"href":64},".",{"title":553,"searchDepth":554,"depth":554,"links":555},"",2,[556,557,558],{"id":435,"depth":554,"text":436},{"id":512,"depth":554,"text":513},{"id":531,"depth":554,"text":532},"Find platform-specific guides for using Vatly as merchant of record. Connect your Lovable or Bolt app and take the next step toward your first test purchase.","md",null,{},true,{"title":403,"description":559},"3mKQQ51EZijppG-SWpQWt_03ug8HbvS3FANDewRApRE",[567,569],{"title":399,"path":400,"stem":401,"description":568,"children":-1},"Vatly Django - Development, support and release",{"title":410,"path":411,"stem":412,"description":570,"children":-1},"Sell European software and digital products from Lovable with Vatly handling tax and invoicing. Start with a test API key and a copy-paste integration prompt.",1794489069092]